      "note": "Self-Insured Medical Insurance Fund budget schedule: receipts under disbursements (778,002) + operating transfers in 838,884 = 60,882, but it prints (389,118) and the fund balance roll-forward 1,899,947 -> 1,510,829. The governmental funds statement (p4) prints this fund's operating transfers out (450,000), which the schedule omits; recorded as printed (no transfers out line in the fund detail)."
